00:23:07.210 --> 00:23:09.620
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.620 --> 00:23:10.880
Go!

00:23:11.710 --> 00:23:14.350
What should I do
for my research project?

00:23:14.350 --> 00:23:17.290
How about researching fossils?

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:19.370
In that case,
to the Museum of Science we...

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:20.190
...go!

00:23:20.190 --> 00:23:22.450
H-Hang on!

00:23:22.450 --> 00:23:24.460
Fossil Excavation sounds fun!

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:26.710
It’s my chance to catch
a Fossil Pokémon!

00:23:26.710 --> 00:23:29.420
Fossils are <i>enchanting!</i>

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:30.850
The Fossil Pokémon!
A Miraculous Restoration,
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:30.850 --> 00:23:35.430
A Miraculous Restoration,
